<title>GERMANY: RWE details nine-month results.</title>
<headline>RWE details nine-month results.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   878     vs 822</p>
<p>    Group sales				  52,932  vs 49,103</p>
<p>    --energy				     16,226  vs 16,466</p>
<p>    --telecommunications		     812     vs 377</p>
<p>    --mining and minerals		    3,032   vs 3,613</p>
<p>    --oil and chemicals			20,073  vs 17,736</p>
<p>    --waste management			 1,223   vs 1,013</p>
<p>    --engineering and plant construction 5,736   vs 5,089</p>
<p>    --construction			     5,797   vs 4,776</p>
<p>    Group investment			   4,300   vs 4,535</p>
<p>    Workforce (average headcount)	  132,711 vs 135,964</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified utility group is RWE AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 756525</p>
</text>
